  "description": "I thought I would be able to escape from my parents' shadow if I got into the university I was aiming for, but a persistent ghost followed me?!\n\nIn order to prevent the ending of becoming the bride of 'Ahn Si-hyeon', the ultimate goal of the former Yoon-eun family, who lived a life of bride training because of the marriage partner decided by her family, she enters into a contract relationship with 'Ko Gi-hyeon', the son of a member of the National Assembly, who is her college classmate... .\n\nNeither he nor he is sane! But why do I keep getting excited between them?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/LUVSTORY)",
